      "description": {
        "en": "Copy every native ranged attack five times, including staff attacks. Spend ammunition, warp charge and overheat once. Native extra projectiles multiply: Surge critical shots produce ten projectiles. Shotgun copies share the original pellet pattern; flame and lightning attacks repeat their native hit pulses, retaining native status stack limits.",
